2 CONT 17 Aug 818 exactly; BIRT place "Vermandois" unconfirmed in the literature (birthplace
2 CONT not established - raised at Fulda, returned to Italy 812); NOTE: en.wiki gives his death
2 CONT as 17 April 818 rather than 17 Aug - death-date variance in the literature, kept as in
2 CONT the tree. it.wiki (Bernardo_d'Italia) confirms 17 Aug 818, Milan, Sant'Ambrogio.
